research/audit/wave4-topology.proof-contracts.json:5852:          "quote": "Let $F$ be an Archimedean ordered field ([[def-archimedean-field]]) and let\n$\\iota : \\mathbb{Q} \\to F$ be the canonical embedding ([[lem-of-q-embeds]]). Then\n$\\iota(\\mathbb{Q})$ is dense in $F$: for any $x < y$ in $F$ there is a rational\n$q$ with $x < \\iota(q) < y$.",
